---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<article class="chapter">
<section class="worksheet-page overview">
<p class="eyebrow">{{ part }} / Chapter {{ number | pad }}</p>
<h1 class="chapter-title">{{ title }}</h1><p class="goal">{{ goal | capitalize }}</p>
<div class="chapter-meta"><span>Difficulty {{ difficulty }} / 5</span><span>{{ duration }}</span><span>{{ printPages }} worksheet pages</span><span>HB · 2B · eraser{% if number == 10 %} · ruler{% endif %}</span></div>
{% set cardMode = 'full' if number >= 19 else 'crop' %}<div class="reference-pair">{% for study in studies %}{% set letter = 'A' if loop.first else 'B' %}{% include 'components/reference-card.njk' %}{% endfor %}</div>{% set cardMode = 'crop' %}
<div class="two-col"><div><h2>01 / Look <small>3–5 min</small></h2><p>{{ look }}</p></div><div><h2>02 / Map</h2><p>{{ map }}</p></div></div>
{% include 'components/analysis.njk' %}
<div class="calibration"><span>50 mm · Print at 100%</span></div>
</section>
{% for study in studies %}{% set letter = 'A' if loop.first else 'B' %}{% include 'components/copy-stage.njk' %}{% endfor %}
<section class="worksheet-page compare-stage"><p class="folio">{{ number | pad }} / {{ shortTitle }} · Compare</p><h2>05 / Compare</h2>{% include 'components/compare-table.njk' %}
<h3>Targeted drill</h3><p>{{ drill }}</p><p class="space-label">Two trials · 180 × 65 mm</p><div class="drawing-space drill-space split-space" aria-label="Drawing area for two drill trials"></div>
<h3>Keep one decision</h3><p>Which choice will you carry into your own drawing? Name the mark and the job it does.</p><div class="writing-lines"></div>
</section>
{% if number == 20 %}
<section class="worksheet-page"><p class="folio">20 / Synthesis · Plan</p><h2>06 / Create — six thumbnails</h2><p>{{ creation }}</p><p>Try six arrangements. Change scale, overlap, empty space, and focal placement before choosing one.</p><div class="thumbnail-grid">{% for i in [1,2,3,4,5,6] %}<div class="drawing-space"><span>{{ i }}</span></div>{% endfor %}</div><p class="space-label">Each thumbnail: 85 × 50 mm</p></section>
<section class="worksheet-page"><p class="folio">20 / Synthesis · Construction & style</p><h2>Construction, then style</h2><p>Make two construction studies: environment first, figure masses second. Below, test the same junction with Edmonds’s sketchbook logic and Flaxman’s economical contour.</p><div class="process-grid">{% for label in ['Construction 1', 'Construction 2', 'Style A — Edmonds', 'Style B — Flaxman'] %}<div><h3>{{ label }}</h3><div class="drawing-space process-space"></div></div>{% endfor %}</div><p class="space-label">Each study: 85 × 75 mm</p></section>
{% elif number == 19 %}
<section class="worksheet-page"><p class="folio">19 / Grouped figures · Plan</p><h2>06 / Create — composition trials</h2><p>Make three 5 cm thumbnails from A and three from B. Change the gaps between figures in three original arrangements below.</p><div class="thumbnail-grid composition-grid">{% for i in [1,2,3,4,5,6] %}<div class="drawing-space"><span>{{ i }}</span></div>{% endfor %}</div><p class="space-label">Each reference thumbnail: 50 × 50 mm. Original arrangement trials below: 180 × 65 mm.</p><div class="drawing-space drill-space"></div></section>
{% endif %}
<section class="worksheet-page creation-task"><p class="folio">{{ number | pad }} / {{ shortTitle }} · Original drawing</p><h2>06 / Create{% if number == 20 %} — final drawing{% endif %}</h2><p>{{ creation }}</p><p>{{ transfer }}</p><p class="space-label">Original study · 180 × {% if number <= 10 %}110{% else %}165{% endif %} mm</p><div class="drawing-space {% if number <= 10 %}early-creation{% else %}final-space{% endif %}"></div>
{% if number <= 10 %}{% include 'components/self-check.njk' %}{% if checkpoint %}{% include 'components/checkpoint-print.njk' %}{% endif %}{% endif %}
</section>
{% if number > 10 %}<section class="worksheet-page review-page"><p class="folio">{{ number | pad }} / {{ shortTitle }} · Review</p>{% include 'components/self-check.njk' %}<h3>{% if number == 20 %}Final self-critique · 150 words maximum{% else %}Revise the weakest structural decision{% endif %}</h3><p>Name one successful decision, one unresolved problem, and one specific next practice.</p><div class="writing-lines tall"></div>{% if number == 20 %}<h3>Return to your baseline</h3><p>Draw your original shoe, plant, or hand again for 15 minutes on a separate sheet. Put both drawings side by side. Compare proportion, line choice, value grouping, and unnecessary detail.</p>{% else %}<p>Redraw a small problem area from memory, then check it against your original study.</p><div class="drawing-space drill-space"></div>{% endif %}{% if checkpoint %}{% include 'components/checkpoint-print.njk' %}{% endif %}</section>{% endif %}
{% if checkpoint %}<aside class="checkpoint screen-only"><p class="eyebrow">Pause & retrieve · 20 minutes</p><h2>A review before the next chapter</h2><p>Choose an earlier creation task. Redraw it on a separate sheet without reopening the lesson, then compare both attempts using that chapter’s self-check. Record one change you can now make deliberately.</p></aside>{% endif %}
<div class="screen-only lesson-notes"><h2>The complete practice sequence</h2>{{ content | safe }}</div>
<nav class="chapter-nav" aria-label="Chapter navigation">{% if previous %}<a href="{{ (previous.url) | url }}">← {{ previous.title }}</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ '/orientation/' | url }}">← Before you begin</a>{% endif %}<a href="{{ '/#curriculum' | url }}">All chapters</a>{% if next %}<a href="{{ (next.url) | url }}">{{ next.title }} →</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ '/orientation/#baseline' | url }}">Return to your baseline →</a>{% endif %}</nav>
</article>
